div></h1><p>In this section, I will outline the key techniques currently us=
ed to enhance the reasoning capabilities of LLMs and to build specialized r=
easoning models such as DeepSeek-R1, OpenAI's o1 &amp; o3, and others.</p><=
p>Note: The exact workings of o1 and o3 remain unknown outside of OpenAI. H=
owever, they are rumored to leverage a combination of both inference and tr=
aining techniques.</p><h2 class=3D"header-anchor-post"><strong>1) Inference=
